  "body": "Nearly Half the CV! Priced at $799,000 against a $1,350,000 CV, this is a rare chance to secure a substantial coastal landholding in sought-after Torbay.\r\n\r\nSet on an expansive 1,017sqm (more or less) elevated freehold site capturing sweeping sea views, this property presents significant upside for developers, builders, or visionary buyers looking to land-bank or build a bespoke seaside residence. Currently occupying the site is a three-bedroom dwelling being sold strictly on an \"as-is, where-is\" basis. The home does not currently meet habitable standards and requires comprehensive renovation or removal to unlock the full potential of this prime parcel of land.\r\n\r\n* Nearly Half the CV: Asking $799,000 vs. $1,350,000 CV-priced for a definite sale.\r\n* Substantial Landholding: 1,017sqm elevated site with wide sea views and strong future value.\r\n* Prime East Coast Bays Location: Minutes to Browns Bay Centre, Torbay shops, local reserves, and pristine beaches.\r\n* Sought-After School Zones: Zoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College.\r\n* Expand Your Footprint: Neighbouring property also on the market for those seeking a larger development site.\r\n* Download the Property Files : https://tinyurl.com/7carlisle \r\n\r\nWith the vendor motivated to meet the market at $799,000, opportunities of this scale and price point in Torbay seldom last. Review the property files, conduct your due diligence, and bring your architect or builder to inspect today.\r\n\r\nContact Roman Hu for further information or to arrange a private viewing. Conjunctional sales with other agencies are welcomed.",
